OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry and
OL,6,Fbright evening, though it will be
OL,7,Flargely cloudy. Cloud will continue to
OL,8,Fthicken overnight, with a few
OL,9,Foutbreaks of rain developing towards
OL,10,Fdawn.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FCloudy with outbreaks of rain
OL,13,Fspreading northwards but turning drier
OL,14,Fthrough the afternoon for a time.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,17,FUnsettled on Tuesday and Wednesday
OL,18,Fwith showers or longer spells of rain,
OL,19,Foften heavy at times. Brighter on
OL,20,FThursday with a few scattered showers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
